/F1 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 759.6 Tm (REWORK IN HIGHWAY PROJECTS: A TEST PAPER) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 740.6 Tm (Canvas de Citas test fixture - not a real publication) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 721.6 Tm (Abstract. There is limited systematic knowledge available about the dynamics of rework in) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 702.6 Tm (highway projects, despite the fact that they frequently exceed budget and schedule by more) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 683.6 Tm (than 10%. A case study of a highway project, which experienced a significant cost overrun) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 664.6 Tm (as a result of rework, is examined and the causal factors that contributed to it are determined.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 645.6 Tm (Keywords: highway projects, rework, system dynamics.) Tj
/F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 622.8000000000001 Tm (1. Introduction) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 603.8000000000001 Tm (The highway transport sector represents a large share of public spending. Cost overruns in) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 584.8000000000001 Tm (transportation infrastructure projects, such as highways, have been identified as being) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 565.8000000000001 Tm (attributable to errors and the subsequent rework that often occurs during construction works.) Tj
